OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start with persistent
OL,6,Fand occasionally heavy rain, and some
OL,7,Fblustery winds at times. This clears
OL,8,Fthrough the morning to allow
OL,9,Fincreasing bright spells and a few
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,13,Fincreasing clear spells and light
OL,14,Fwinds. Staying dry and becoming chilly
OL,15,Fovernight with a rural grass frost
OL,16,Fdeveloping in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
