OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and bright but chilly
OL,6,Fstart. Sunshine turning hazy as high
OL,7,Fcloud gradually spills east through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon ahead of rain in the
OL,9,Fevening. Gusty winds developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAny
OL,12,Fcloud and rain soon clearing east
OL,13,FFriday morning to become dry with
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Bright spells and just
OL,15,Fthe odd shower on Saturday. Showery
OL,16,Frain spreads east on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
